data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dispatch_dev_1.md\", \"content\": \"# Task for dev\\n\\nImplement the following in the subject repository, on your own branch:\\n\\n1. `src/greet.py` containing a function `greet(name)` that returns the string\\n   `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (e.g. `greet(\\\"Ada\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`).\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` with unittest test case(s) covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. `greet(\\\"Ada\\\")` == `\\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`)\\n   - the empty string (e.g. `greet(\\\"\\\")` == `\\\"Hello, !\\\"`)\\n3. Run `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` yourself and confirm it exits 0\\n   (no failures, no errors). Paste the command output in your reply.\\n\\nCommit your work to your own branch before replying. Reply with what you did,\\nincluding the exact test command you ran and its exit status/output.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

